OL,3,GNEWSANo unconditional support to arms
OL,4,Aindustry, says Welsh government
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is helping to
OL,7,Fsponsor the event in Newport but has
OL,8,Fnot sent a minister. A 72-year-old
OL,9,Fwoman and seven others were arrested at
OL,10,Fa protest outside.
